[{"title":"燕歌卷为祝秀才题","author":"陈琛","text":"忆昔少年胆气粗，羞为弱女具眉须。\n张拳直欲撄猛虎，开眼何曾见俗夫。\n年来英气消磨尽，事不能平唯有忍。\n时逢徭僚肆撞突，和颜温词谢不敏。\n男儿胸中富甲兵，善藏其用用斯精。\n动在九天藏九地，机缄谁会测沈冥。\n素冠白衣易水上，周身先已失屏障。\n好勇由来笑匹夫，北风萧萧空悲壮。\n越人来燕作燕歌，慷慨激烈恨何多。\n有疾未必非君福，美玉正应山石磨。\n与君美酒博君笑，丁宁莫学我年少。\n燕歌为我转和平，高筇从此生清妙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26878,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春晴对酒简王閒斋","author":"陈琛","text":"积雨伤春半，忽晴欣日迟。\n江山皆景色，花草自天时。\n独饮吾难醉，有怀君未知。\n何时同旧榻，清语破前疑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26879,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送吴司训擢罗城教谕","author":"陈琛","text":"对花呼酒数，留客索诗频。\n谈笑真惊座，风流迥出尘。\n车圆何择地，春好总宜人。\n闻说罗城柳，年来亦转新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26880,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金陵别诸朋旧往淮安至江上有所思 其一","author":"陈琛","text":"黯黯一年别，迢迢千里行。\n论交期晚节，顾我自多情。\n涉世防深阱，看山忆旧盟。\n谁为元德秀，眉宇向人情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26881,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金陵别诸朋旧往淮安至江上有所思 其二","author":"陈琛","text":"百年将欲半，一艺不能长。\n进德惭多病，观书苦健忘。\n情真时忤俗，意豁转成狂。\n蘧瑗吾师也，知非且自强。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26882,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丁亥元旦试笔","author":"陈琛","text":"艳艳灯花发，霏霏江雨匀。\n柳从梅作色，人与物俱春。\n拜起勤双膝，欢呼动四邻。\n酒杯三百后，静坐养吾真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26883,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送刘司训迁合江掌教且便道还万安","author":"陈琛","text":"秋声入井梧，凉气生高竹。\n欲别此先生，稍烦我心曲。\n光风久在闽，化雨将行蜀。\n归去近重阳，清樽还对菊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26884,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠高抑斋太守 其一","author":"陈琛","text":"松柏挺涧幽，果有二千尺。\n古貌阅岁年，何曾改今昔。\n逍遥陶隐居，杖履散踪迹。\n闻风爱厥声，不说堪柱石。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26885,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠高抑斋太守 其二","author":"陈琛","text":"人生在世间，谈笑无百年。\n百年亦瞬息，生理忽茫然。\n惟有桐乡爱，庙食自绵绵。\n天地同悠久，讵肯称神仙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26886,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠高抑斋太守 其三","author":"陈琛","text":"翚飞甚峻整，上界真人居。\n其奈为官府，案牍日纷如。\n终日勤视听，耳目不能虚。\n何如作散仙，杖履自徐徐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26887,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠高抑斋太守 其四","author":"陈琛","text":"凤阳中都地，山水秀而平。\n赤气光腾后，犹能生俊英。\n五马亦高贵，一笑澹无荣。\n乃知天下士，但欲乞身轻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26888,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠高抑斋太守 其五","author":"陈琛","text":"东溪通黄河，万里自天上。\n饮流寻其源，月掬光在掌。\n九曲来棹歌，静夜得清响。\n光霁正无边，劳我驰梦想。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26889,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"甲戌下第三月二十四日出张家湾","author":"陈琛","text":"闻说春归已有期，可人春色亦应稀。\n客思远道催行急，舟绕长湾故去迟。\n江上一樽忘独老，天涯何处觅相知。\n怀中多少平生梦，说向痴人恐未宜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26890,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"下邳晚泊","author":"陈琛","text":"远嶂依依起夕氛，长河滚滚自天浑。\n圯边取履怜孺子，天下英雄识使君。\n千载功名惟故迹，几人梦想不浮云。\n月中光景应无限，清借人间知几分。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26891,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵题小丹丘","author":"陈琛","text":"白云缥渺四时留，青壁回环尽自幽。\n露竹珠涵沧海月，风松波撼洞庭秋。\n窝中巳足逍遥乐，顶上还堪汗漫游。\n待看羽翰生白日，人间始信有丹丘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26892,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚步玉河桥有怀","author":"陈琛","text":"芳草萋萋万里同，远游谁敢恨东风。\n得官更觉贫中味，经事方知静处功。\n城外好山来紫翠，河边细水入玲珑。\n美人胸次无沾染，颜色犹应似旧红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26893,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寓金台遣怀","author":"陈琛","text":"销除旧恨出新篇，转觉情多不入禅。\n望远可堪云隔水，思归正有日如年。\n生憎不饮花浑醉，偏爱无愁柳欲眠。\n风雨也应知客意，晓来收拾作晴天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26894,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送潘东崖助教","author":"陈琛","text":"古道蓁芜今几秋，飞花尽逐水东流。\n王门莫笑徒工瑟，野渡行看欲放舟。\n方寸地中收汗马，五车书里破全牛。\n平生我爱真豪杰，不数文章谁最优。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26895,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"茂松清泉图为潘东崖赋","author":"陈琛","text":"逍遥谷里自容身，此老当年亦识真。\n白眼那堪常对客，青山终是不生尘。\n微风入树琴清耳，积石明泉玉可人。\n都付东崖长作主，多应借我往来频。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26896,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送林君信巡按江西","author":"陈琛","text":"剑锋耿耿逼虹霓，高枕时闻半夜鸡。\n腾踏忽惊空冀北，激扬先喜到江西。\n鹅湖水满鱼争跃，鹿洞云深路不迷。\n如此湖山閒一赏，就中更有上天梯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26897,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"一峰亭为乡同年方世元尊甫侍御作","author":"陈琛","text":"松竹交青远映空，梅花时见白重重。\n小车花外开三径，高枕亭前见一峰。\n独乐人应识司马，上床我已厌元龙。\n登临剩有平生屐，留与仙郎蹑旧踪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26898,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠蒋悟非","author":"陈琛","text":"秋发鲈莼野色开，故人江上赋归来。\n觉非正喜今朝是，忤俗休生旧日猜。\n到处烟波横钓艇，有时风月上瑶台。\n人生如此须知足，管甚经纶屈大才。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26899,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"庚辰季夏南都即事","author":"陈琛","text":"谁将大有卜今年，春种初苗旱可怜。\n受暑苦焚唯问马，从公弗息几归田。\n流离有态堪图画，恸哭无声到管弦。\n万顷烟波舟一叶，何人正在白鸥边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26900,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立春后到淮安夜坐书怀","author":"陈琛","text":"欲借春风一解颜，春来正在舳舻间。\n严持酒戒偏能饭，稍放书程亦自閒。\n心里有天堪白日，眼中何地不青山。\n千周未了参同契，一炷清香坐夜阑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26901,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题云深处小景","author":"陈琛","text":"是处山深云更深，凭谁说与总无心。\n全因俗客都迷路，时为苍生欲作霖。\n静映方塘惟旱亩，高临绝壁亦千寻。\n优游更逐南溪水，流向人间觅赏音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26902,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寓金陵感秋","author":"陈琛","text":"俯仰周旋强作颜，将心能得几时安。\n读书尽说居官易，得路方知涉世难。\n三径西风黄菊瘦，一天秋水白鸥寒。\n易图元有真消息，姤复中间子细看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26903,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乙酉元日病中试笔寄田南山王一臞","author":"陈琛","text":"昨夜东风入敝庐，晓来门外见新符。\n山茶映水回春色，樽酒招人起病夫。\n破戒一斟将兴发，从渠三劝觅愁无。\n意中我了南山老，应有杯盘对老癯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26904,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元夕僧房独坐","author":"陈琛","text":"轻风入树晚萧萧，僧院松关坐寂寥。\n野外无人堪笑语，静中随地足逍遥。\n残编漫对皆灯火，清韵微吟当管箫。\n此是元宵真乐事，楼台争得羡岧峣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26905,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜雨录呈谢松涧分守","author":"陈琛","text":"年来学稼事西畴，四体徒勤亦半收。\n谁谓乾封系天意，吾将辟谷与仙游。\n春风满袖来天使，甘雨随车喜泽流。\n分付家僮多种秫，陶翁行醉菊花秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26906,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"平寇二首为聂分巡赋 其一","author":"陈琛","text":"许多英伟说前筹，遥望前锋气即收。\n可是赤眉真有力，祇因白面自深忧。\n何人发愤身皆胆，一道凄清月满秋。\n百万农夫喧笑口，谁家鸡犬不蒙庥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26907,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"平寇二首为聂分巡赋 其二","author":"陈琛","text":"法司兵法信如何，曾拜当年马伏波。\n铜柱嵯峨凌石塔，瘴江明净出烟萝。\n归田老叟无称颂，入树秋声当凯歌。\n我在沧洲闻信息，也携樽酒舞渔蓑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26908,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题笋江清泛图","author":"陈琛","text":"五月清溪已得秋，小舟荡漾在中流。\n庄生久解濠梁意，何处江山不自由。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26909,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"思过亭","author":"陈琛","text":"林野生来失佩韦，回头四十九年非。\n故乡寸地堪思想，莫恋并州不肯归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26910,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"兰畹","author":"陈琛","text":"独清独醒思幽幽，中夜无为独远游。\n尽道屈平远不死，至今兰畹在湘流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26911,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与高太守索历日","author":"陈琛","text":"诗书笔砚带烟霞，寂寞柴扉自一家。\n要看好春无历日，漫将消息问梅花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26912,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠二守李春江","author":"陈琛","text":"彭蠡春深不可涯，小姑江上立崔嵬。\n东西贾客倾囊出，祇见渔船载雪归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26913,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵朱教谕题邑庠讲堂 其一","author":"陈琛","text":"扫地焚香澹得清，眼中何物胜明经。\n刘郎到此应为主，莫遣苔荒百亩庭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26914,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵朱教谕题邑庠讲堂 其二","author":"陈琛","text":"坐稳蒲团想太清，先天画外得全经。\n四时长觉春无恙，谁讶秋深草满庭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26915,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵朱教谕题邑庠讲堂 其三","author":"陈琛","text":"芙蓉擎露出轻清，不用研朱碎点经。\n最笑仙人知我浅，时来教取读黄庭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26916,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与郭长洲年兄","author":"陈琛","text":"清淮去岁忆同舟，枫落吴江又一秋。\n莫怪道人情亦冷，曾随孤月到长洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26917,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和朱大尹新正写怀","author":"杨廉","text":"潭潭道爱堂，素不通杂客。\n况当正旦初，公事少关白。\n尝观循吏传，声誉无赫赫。\n如公真其人，清暇事文墨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26918,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和朱大尹郊行叠前韵","author":"杨廉","text":"长安簪绂者，软尘恋东华。\n谁知程鄠县，独爱前川花。\n今晨偶无事，行行临水涯。\n农功自兹始，辛苦念田家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26919,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题张御史夫妇忠节录","author":"杨廉","text":"正统己巳秋，北兵来犯塞。\n权奸劝亲征，请留徒至再。\n六飞驻宣府，已报前军败。\n大同暮安营，黑气罩如盖。\n仓卒议旋师，铁骑追已逮。\n土木望怀来，未在一舍外。\n彼奸辎重多，牵制姑少待。\n四十万貔貅，饥渴俱困惫。\n长刀如墙来，斗志我巳怠。\n乘舆既蒙尘，绣斧旋遇害。\n主辱臣死之，明训简编载。\n南朝李侍郎，心事本同派。\n夫人闻讣音，呼天竟无奈。\n诸孤属未亡，一死非所爱。\n共姜矢柏舟，凛凛冰蘖在。\n彼苍祐善人，后福殊未艾。\n双凤已高骞，仲也尤大拜。\n尚留忠节名，永永昭百代。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26920,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过闸简莫水部","author":"杨廉","text":"疏闸密闸连一带，南船北船此关隘。\n往年水小谨启闭，十目五日闸边待。\n今年济水偶然溢，雪浪奔腾复砰湃。\n下如落井上登天，三老无功神是赖。\n谁移两山作一门，管束千流与万派。\n当初本为畜水设，岂知水大亦为阂。\n世间未有无敝法，十利未免兼一害。\n人言月河且缓筑，不然水势无由杀。\n闸官恨不高于山，设心措意或有在。\n冬官先生大气力，能令驽钝追骥快。\n征夫自是怀往途，见月望弦今已再。\n履霜又恐阻冰冻，帝乡尚在红云外。\n噫嘻水大莫怨迟，还胜从前水小时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26921,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"歌风台","author":"杨廉","text":"被酒径泽隆准公，巨蛇溅血污剑锋。\n鬼媪啾啾夜深哭，红旗昼满山之东。\n入关坚守牧羝约，亲与降王除面缚。\n以宽易暴法三章，告谕秦民皆喜跃。\n董公遮道天遣来，发丧义帝师衔哀。\n尝闻伯者假仁义，汉伯一著先胚胎。\n范增趣舞谋自拙，玉斗何辜碎如雪。\n伤残所过无一言，惟对君王数持玦。\n一仁一暴胜负分，况有豪杰纷如云。\n义旗东向无不捷，蹙项直至乌江濆。\n归来丰沛乘黄屋，醉后高歌仍击筑。\n千秋游子思故乡，特令此邑为汤沐。\n我来访台正落晖，两碑对立高墙围。\n台边古井不可问，千年事往人民非。\n炎汉开基未为窄，泗上荒台仅寻尺。\n兴亡百战无代无，登高一啸秋空碧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26922,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题林待用所画山水为王员郎作","author":"杨廉","text":"王君此画来何从，自言昨得之林公。\n公心欣然为挥写，苍烟老树山重重。\n莓苔无尘水石净，中有袒裼遐栖翁。\n养高习静君夙志，无乃聊寓烟霞胸。\n我言是境皆脱洒，朝市亦有山林风。\n正闻部符忽相促，淮阳征?行匆匆。\n诗人王事念靡盬，未许箕踞休长松。\n淮阳莆阳地虽异，公斋对此将无同。\n不见濂溪庐阜下，曾志乡关在目中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26923,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"莲龟呈祥庆人寿","author":"杨廉","text":"泥中曳尾尘土缘，何如轻举游红莲。\n花开玉井长十丈，瑞钟洛水经千年。\n争如老子学辟谷，捉得灵龟当床足。\n如雷鼻息撼蓬瀛，一睡交梨一回熟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26924,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"食梨戏作","author":"杨廉","text":"鹅声鹢鹢梨百颗，多谢乡人远遗我。\n放鹅出笼且养之，爱渠日浴当清池。\n梨择数颗呼爨仆，缊火爇薪为蒸熟。\n擎来去柄削其皮，软脆颇足充吾饥。\n记得往年涉远道，南北两京梨最好。\n就中二美堪齐驱，雪梨香水天下无。\n风滋露味生最上，熟之似员方竹杖。\n西江所产涩者多，间如嚼木齿欲讹。\n是品只可令熟啖，不比两京熟味淡。\n噫嘻凡物皆有宜，岂独区区口腹梨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26925,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和储静夫户侍元武湖","author":"杨廉","text":"群公湖上欣持杯，此会难再须徘徊。\n百年籍册比铜版，祖皇严令如春雷。\n就中半字谁敢裂，冤抑扣之自能雪。\n环以波光水气寒，六月那知有炎热。\n千棂万牖诸库开，我初见之犹惊猜。\n承平户口转增益，但睹万国梯航来。\n我朝声教皆渐被，周礼司徒掌舆地。\n示来诗句何铿锵，剩有高才敌宾戏。\n中洲去岸六七里，犹忆宿湖霄曳履。\n画船上锁金钥收，极目惟看渺瀰水。\n一来五日耗不通，纱窗夜夜明晴虹。\n魂清少寐歌达旦，馀音下撼蛟龙宫。\n廿年不到湖上路，回首光阴如箭去。\n澄波照影衰鬓蓬，自觉容颜已非故。\n沿堤高柳仍含烟，钟山一幅罨画然。\n无端往事不可问，惟有景物如当年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26926,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"折桂寺","author":"杨廉","text":"境岂浮屠胜，东南秀此峰。\n涧流千丈瀑，崖长万年松。\n少室留苍鹿，番君现小龙。\n布鞋从此制，云峤寄遐踪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26927,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵张汝霖和潘黄门斋居二首 其一 庆寿寺","author":"杨廉","text":"禅室由来静，幽偏更此亭。\n天斋闲数日，夜坐或观星。\n对越惟精白，功名要汗青。\n昔年陪锁闼，从未此居停。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26928,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵张汝霖和潘黄门斋居二首 其二 神乐观","author":"杨廉","text":"明衣新样制，端默坐斯亭。\n议礼严郊社，分坛首日星。\n祼将牌累白，扈跸幕连青。\n夜久千官转，銮舆待晓停。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26929,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玉山察院和壁间韵","author":"杨廉","text":"舍棹还趍陆，停舆也驻骢。\n阴重台上柏，画黯壁间松。\n雨后蛙争聚，春深卉斗浓。\n喉襟南北地，万里尽尧封。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26930,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"除夕东湖录唐子西诗见示同和其韵","author":"杨廉","text":"光阴真转毂，此夜岁云徂。\n潦倒仍縻禄，羁愁自作孤。\n漏长频剪烛，寒甚懒围炉。\n静想归田语，奚为竟不符。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26931,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书荻港驿","author":"杨廉","text":"客怀祇合醉腾腾，荻港来沽酒十升。\n贫户为垣编白苇，小墟陈货挂青藤。\n乾坤好似阅人传，身世浑如行脚僧。\n喜是邮夫供笔墨，聊将履历记吾曾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26932,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"道傍废宅","author":"杨廉","text":"破屋三间古道西，蓬蒿门外与腰齐。\n鼠留旧穴妖蛇入，鸡别空埘野雉啼。\n庭草有痕曾接烧，上墙无覆半颓泥。\n感伤岂独王承福，马上行人亦惨悽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26933,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹枕","author":"杨廉","text":"剖篁编枕荷朋分，携向南窗卧火云。\n节上带来风露气，床头爱看水波纹。\n广藤恨软非能耐，布被还清合与群。\n西华睡臣唯片石，可人争似渭川君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26934,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"邂逅张克修时闻李天瑞邹汝愚贬官","author":"杨廉","text":"卧病湖头少送迎，春风一笑故交情。\n几年逐客无消息，此日斯文喜合并。\n往事不妨于我诉，新閒更是使人惊。\n尊前只用沈沈醉，分付苍头酒尽倾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26935,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻邹汝愚言事","author":"杨廉","text":"燕台消息近全无，忽见封章出汝愚。\n此日读来惊吐舌，当时投进分捐躯。\n洛阳自古称年少，西蜀于今有丈夫。\n愧我恰如君疏语，江湖泛泛水中凫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26936,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居静乐为范君赋","author":"杨廉","text":"厌住城中住范塘，应怜水色与山光。\n欲耕不似人无地，习静须知自有方。\n惯看庭前儿扑枣，勤呼墙下仆栽桑。\n数声啼鸟林花落，坐爱居閒岁月长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26937,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"庆成燕和吴懋贞韵","author":"杨廉","text":"苍壁先朝礼百神，赭袍今日宴臣邻。\n盛分折俎圜丘胙，屡赐深杯内法春。\n虞室赓歌同浃洽，周家王业起艰辛。\n由来致泰须君子，试数夔龙在要津。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26938,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]